			D40994: TOTAL DEVIATION $ NOT SHOWING IN DEVIATION GRID WHEN BILLBACK IS OPENED INITIALLY (SHOWS 2ND TIME)/Anand Rao/13-Jan-2014
			The below function was added, so that the Total deviation value will start showing after the deviation is loaded and incase, 
			the Total Deviation did not load due to some reason, which was reported in this label. 
			*/
			public function fnDevTotalChecker():void
			{
				if (!this.DevTotalLoadChecked)
				{	
					addTotalDeviation();
					this.DevTotalLoadChecked = true;
				}
				else
				{
					this.DevTotalLoadChecked = true;
				}
				
			}
			
